WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.011
To identify correlation look for an alias that was
defined outside the subquery but used

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:10.784
inside it If the inner query needs p patient ID from
the outer patient

00:00:10.797 --> 00:00:16.484
row it is correlated A quick diagnostic is to ask
whether the inner

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:22.022
query can run meaningfully by itself unchanged If it
needs an outer

00:00:22.048 --> 00:00:23.641
value the answer is no
